OL,3,GNEWSAElectric bus operator concerned
OL,4,Aabout 'slogan' #2 fare cap
OL,5,
OL,6,FElectric bus company Ember says the
OL,7,FScottish government's #2 cap on bus
OL,8,Ffares is a "good slogan" but claims it
OL,9,Fcould do more to support routes across
OL,10,FScotland.
OL,12,FThe cap is running as a pilot in six
OL,13,Flocal authority areas and First
OL,14,FMinister John Swinney announced it is
OL,15,Fto be extended to cover journeys in the
OL,16,Fwest of Scotland from Monday.
OL,18,FEmber, which operates intercity routes
OL,19,Facross Scotland, said it was "strongly
OL,20,Fsupportive" of the new scheme's goals
OL,21,Fbut had concerns about how it would
OL,22,Fwork across different areas.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
