OL,3,GNEWSAElectric bus operator concerned
OL,4,Aabout 'slogan' #2 fare cap
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport Scotland said the cap would
OL,7,Fsupport households facing
OL,8,Fcost-of-living challenges, and bus
OL,9,Ffirms could choose whether or not to
OL,10,Ftake part in the scheme.
